MANDS: fixes recorded, stale schedule facts corrected\n031b5b6 WORKFLOW.md: the ideal day, week and semester across every skill and job\n9c5303e router: project-triage is the live board now (render.py retired)\n\nClaude Code attached this context automatically; it isn't part of the user's message. It describes the user's own account and workspace, so they don't need it reported back.\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"user","session_id":"c8cd7806-9ebb-4a31-9ea2-52a66b3eb4e0","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV","sessionId":"c8cd7806-9ebb-4a31-9ea2-52a66b3eb4e0","version":"2.1.292","gitBranch":"main"}
